From: AX1800 Pro compatibility fixes <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] nikki-rs: supply safe TLS verify default for Hysteria2

clash-rs v0.20.0-alpha declares OutboundHysteria2.skip_cert_verify
as a required bool. Many Mihomo subscriptions omit the field.
Normalize the assembled run profile rather than the subscription so
refreshes and manually added nodes receive the same fix.
Preserve existing true/false values and continue verifying certificates
when omitted.

--- a/nikki-rs/files/nikki-rs.init
+++ b/nikki-rs/files/nikki-rs.init
@@ -120,5 +120,8 @@ mixin_profile() (
 		fi
 	fi
+	# clash-rs v0.20.0-alpha requires skip-cert-verify for Hysteria2.
+	# Missing means verify certificates; do not change explicit true/false.
+	yq -M -i '(.proxies[] | select(.type == "hysteria2" and .["skip-cert-verify"] == null))["skip-cert-verify"] = false' "$RUN_PROFILE_PATH" 2>> "$APP_LOG_PATH" || exit 1
 	mv -f "$RUN_PROFILE_PATH" "$mixin_target" || exit 1
 )
 
